This repository holds Graphicle Core: the graphicle program (crates/graphicle/),
the graph engine (crates/graphicle-graph/), the memory library
(crates/graphicle-memory/) and the SDKs (sdk/).

This product includes software adapted from Graphify
(https://github.com/Graphify-Labs/graphify): release 0.9.95, commit
92741d162b2094ffc2fed58cfbd8ee823e9da62c, and the earlier pinned revisions
10130e79ed9caf8f60d998073e097531eaa1a395 (release 0.9.91),
a9860f70dc3cc2e9c2d8cb923484cfa0592b9067 (release 0.9.88),
5c7b84792f453582676548185aaec3824d51dfe2 (release 0.9.77),
20a20d30d8e7eef77675651f0199d87f913bd3e7 and
0010e25d0d983bc127cef0ee0f7e490bed74e44c. Files adapted from Graphify carry a
header naming the upstream release and files;
crates/graphicle-graph/migration/ADAPTED.json lists them.

